flowchart LR
  DEV[Developer] --> BUILD[docker build]
  BUILD --> ECR[Amazon ECR]
  ECR --> ECS[ECS Fargate x5<br/>ALB + Cloud Map]
  ECR --> EKS[EKS Deployments<br/>k8s/aws/]
  EH[(Azure Event Hubs<br/>cross-cloud)] --> ECS
  EH --> EKS
  AZF[Azurite Fargate] --> ECS
  AZK[Azurite in-cluster] --> EKS
